[gd_scene load_steps=43 format=3]

; Low-poly farm building, scaled to match the city's other models: individual
; structures are roughly building-sized (~2x2 footprint, heights in the 2.2-3.7
; band) on a single 8x9 farm lot. Visual content is built from primitive meshes.
; The root keeps the Farm.gd contract used by the economy/job systems: it stays
; in the "buildings" group, exposes an "Entrance" Node3D, and keeps a clickable
; "ClickArea". All solid structures share one "Obstacles" StaticBody3D on physics
; layer 1, with a gate gap on the +Z side so citizens can reach the entrance.
; Crop detail uses MultiMeshInstance3D to keep the scene cheap when many farms
; are present.

